   "beat": "The First AD: Book twelve. The Sirens. Rowers, stroke. / The Director: Action. / The Director: They look like a loop. / The Cinematographer: One clock. A stroke every two point six seconds. / A Rower: I'm four hundredths of a second late. / Another Rower: Three hundredths early. / The Helmsman: I don't row. I steer. / A Siren: We sing on a clock of our own. / The Director: Print it. / A Rower: What? / The First AD: Wax in their ears. It's in the scene. / The First AD: I'll check on all of you at the top of the hour.",
